# Submission recovery follow-up

- Give refused local retirement of a write-mode switch its own withdrawal
  failure fact. Today `driver.withdrawControl` retains the switch and publishes
  a new unsaved occurrence, but the row says "Couldn't switch" with Retry (Stop
  remains available). If storage refuses deletion, recovery should retry the
  withdrawal rather than post the switch. Map that fact in `owner.ts` to
  `switch-withdraw-failed`.
